A '''Young Couple''' (Japanese: '''ラブラブカップル''' ''Love-Love Couple'') are a pair of [[Pokémon Trainer]]s that first debuted in the [[Generation III]] games. They are depicted as a couple in their teens or early twenties.

They use {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} usually of opposite [[gender]]s or in duos for [[Double Battle]]s.

