A Young Couple appeared briefly in ''[[PO03|File 3: Giovanni]]''. {{OBP|Red|Origins}} overheard them talking about the [[Viridian Gym]] and how [[Giovanni|its Leader]] had just returned after a long absence.
{{-}}

