[[File:Young Couple Adventures.png|thumb|220px|A Young Couple in Pokémon Adventures]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
A Young Couple appeared in ''[[PS361|Bombastic Bibarel & Heroic Hippopotas]]'', eager for a battle in the [[Seven Stars Restaurant]].

A Young Couple appeared in ''[[PS390|Licking Lickitung]]'' during the [[Pokétch]] presentation that was taking place in [[Jubilife City]].
